narrow Transformation:

narrow tranformation opertes on single partition and do not require data shuffle(map.filter,select)


wide transformation:
this wide transformation  requires shuffling  across the partition and nodes
(groupby ,join,repartition)

 narrow transformation are faster  and more efficient  beacuse they avoid expensive network input/output

wide transformation  trigger shuffle operation  which involves disk and network making them coster in term  of performance
 understanding the difference optimizing the jobs by minizing the widw transformation where possible
